From: Ember <ember@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 89/95] programs-csrss: Ember changes

Base: CrossOver 26.3.0 FOSS sources/wine
License: same as the upstream file (LGPL-2.1-or-later for Wine/DXMT; see LICENSES/)
---
diff --git a/programs/csrss/Makefile.in b/programs/csrss/Makefile.in
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e6fe20d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/programs/csrss/Makefile.in
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+MODULE    = csrss.exe
+IMPORTS   = ntdll
+
+EXTRADLLFLAGS = -mwindows
+
+SOURCES = \
+	main.c
diff --git a/programs/csrss/main.c b/programs/csrss/main.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0ddffda
--- /dev/null
+++ b/programs/csrss/main.c
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+/*
+ * csrss.exe
+ *
+ * Copyright 2026 bluechxin
+ *
